        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970 / AMD Radeon 400 Series or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR. Oculus/Steam motion controllers or Gamepad/HOTAS.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Installation of SteamVR required for VR support.</li></ul>"
